    "en": {
      "trackName": "WristGames - Watch Games",
      "description": "Your pocket arcade, right on your wrist.\n\nRaise your wrist to start playing. Turn a few spare minutes while waiting for the bus, standing in line, or taking a break into quick gaming sessions.\n\n11 mini-games specially crafted for Apple Watch bring the fun of arcade gaming straight to your wrist. Tap the screen or rotate the Digital Crown to jump right in—even without internet or your iPhone nearby.\n\nWith 11 games available, there's always one that keeps you coming back for \"one more round\":\n• Tic Tac Toe: Be the first to line up three in a row\n• Pong: Bounce the ball back and be the first to score 5 points\n• Tricky Circle: Dodge obstacles and survive as long as you can\n• Whack A Bug: Test your reflexes and crush the bugs\n• Space Defender: Switch lanes to fend off incoming enemies\n• Ground Defense: Aim at incoming targets and hold down the base\n• Pass the Ball: Time it right and break your continuous passing record\n• Fast Match: Instantly decide if two symbols match\n• Match’em: Flip cards to reveal and match six pairs\n• Sliding Blocks: Slide the blocks to arrange numbers 1–8\n• Watch & Repeat: Memorize the colors and repeat ever-longer sequences\n\nDesigned specifically for Apple Watch\nPlay using touch, the Digital Crown, and haptic feedback. Every game is tailored for short sessions and feels natural to play on a watch.\n\nA new goal every day\nDaily Challenges combine three different games into a quick set of tasks. Complete the challenge, check your scores, and keep beating your personal bests.\n\nTurn your watch into a controller\nIn Watch Controller mode, your iPhone displays the game while your Apple Watch handles control inputs and haptic feedback.\n\nJump straight into the action\nLaunch games or today’s challenge directly via Widgets, Watch Face Complications, or Shortcuts.\n\nAll 11 games are completely free to play, with more updates to come. Your next game is ready whenever you are.",
